{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏だねぇ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【第二章】學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』ー決戦のマイムマイムー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛公演期間中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ぱっつん黒髪ロング、なうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだまで金髪ショートだったのに！騒がしい私の髪の毛！（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑舞台メイク濃い(　  ˙-˙　 )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループの活動とは違う舞台に立って、学ぶことが沢山ありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人で不安になったり怖くなったりすることもありましたが、いい経験でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨年の第一章から一年経ちましたが、今年もまた帝一の國に帰ってこれてよかったです。\n少しでも成長できたかなぁ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私にとっては、今日のソワレが東京千秋楽となります。\nもう最後だなんて...なんだか寂しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと2公演がんばるぞー！おー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、帝一の國ブログのほうにも\nお当番が来たので見てね♪\n▼ http://yaplog.jp/teiichi/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、休む暇なく\n夏の全国ツアーに向けての動きも、\n着々と進んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また色々と、並行しての日々が続いています。\n忙しいのはとても有難いです。\nいつもよりボーッとしてしまうけど。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!5   見て下さった方、\n有難うございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんには、お話を振りたいなーと思ってたのです。笑\n心許せるひめたんにだからできる、氷対応"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐いてる人に\nちょっかい出すの好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見せかけ天使...(   ˙-˙   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃん、お誕生日おめでとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私のもお母さんも\n16日がお誕生日でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親孝行..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/07/18/8852092/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}